{
  "id": "combustion_processes_and_combustion_efficiency",
  "title": "Combustion Processes and Combustion Efficiency",
  "description": "Calculate furnace performance indices including thermal efficiency, annual fuel utilization efficiency (AFUE), and steady-state efficiency (SSE) based on energy inputs and outputs.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Combustion Processes and Combustion Efficiency\n\nCombustion is an exothermic reaction between a fuel and an oxidant.\n\n### Common Combustion Reactions\n\n- Carbon: C + O₂ → CO₂\n- Methane: CH₄ + 2O₂ → CO₂ + 2H₂O\n- Hydrogen: H₂ + ½O₂ → H₂O\n\n### Typical Combustion Process Efficiency\n\n- Home fireplace: 10 - 40%\n- Space heater: 50 - 80%\n- Residential gas furnace: 70 - 80%\n- Oil burner heating system: 70 - 85%\n- Gas powered boiler: 75 - 85%\n- High efficiency gas or oil condensing furnace: 85 - 95%"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Thermal Efficiency",
        "Annual Fuel Utilization Efficiency (AFUE)",
        "Steady-State Efficiency (SSE)"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "energy_output",
          "label": "Energy Output (Eo)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "W",
          "defaultValue": 10000
        },
        {
          "id": "fuel_energy_input",
          "label": "Fuel Energy Input (Ei)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "W",
          "defaultValue": 12500
        },
        {
          "id": "annual_energy_output",
          "label": "Annual Energy Output (Eao)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "Wh",
          "defaultValue": 50000000
        },
        {
          "id": "annual_fuel_energy_input",
          "label": "Annual Fuel Energy Input (Eai)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "Wh",
          "defaultValue": 62500000
        },
        {
          "id": "energy_loss",
          "label": "Energy Loss (El)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "W",
          "defaultValue": 2500
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "thermal_efficiency",
          "label": "Thermal Efficiency (μt)",
          "formula": "100 * inputs.energy_output / inputs.fuel_energy_input",
          "unit": "%",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "afue",
          "label": "Annual Fuel Utilization Efficiency (AFUE)",
          "formula": "100 * inputs.annual_energy_output / inputs.annual_fuel_energy_input",
          "unit": "%",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "steady_state_efficiency",
          "label": "Steady-State Efficiency (SSE)",
          "formula": "100 * (inputs.fuel_energy_input - inputs.energy_loss) / inputs.fuel_energy_input",
          "unit": "%",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}